{"words": [{"text": "وَظَلَّلْنَا", "translation": "And We shaded"}, {"text": "عَلَيْكُمُ", "translation": "[over] you"}, {"text": "ٱلْغَمَامَ", "translation": "(with) [the] clouds"}, {"text": "وَأَنزَلْنَا", "translation": "and We sent down"}, {"text": "عَلَيْكُمُ", "translation": "to you"}, {"text": "ٱلْمَنَّ", "translation": "[the] manna"}, {"text": "وَٱلسَّلْوَىٰ ۖ", "translation": "and [the] quails"}, {"text": "كُلُوا۟", "translation": "Eat"}, {"text": "مِن", "translation": "from"}, {"text": "طَيِّبَـٰتِ", "translation": "(the) good things"}, {"text": "مَا", "translation": "that"}, {"text": "رَزَقْنَـٰكُمْ ۖ", "translation": "We have provided you"}, {"text": "وَمَا", "translation": "And not"}, {"text": "ظَلَمُونَا", "translation": "they wronged Us"}, {"text": "وَلَـٰكِن", "translation": "but"}, {"text": "كَانُوٓا۟", "translation": "they were"}, {"text": "أَنفُسَهُمْ", "translation": "(to) themselves"}, {"text": "يَظْلِمُونَ", "translation": "doing wrong"}], "sahih": "And We shaded you with clouds and sent down to you manna and quails, [saying], \"Eat from the good things with which We have provided you.\" And they wronged Us not - but they were [only] wronging themselves."}